  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Four combinations of two thin lenses are given in List I. The radius of curvature of all curved surfaces is r and the refractive index of all the lenses is 1.5. Match lens combinations in List I with their focal length in List II and select the correct answer using the code given below the lists.<br/> </p><table border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td> </td><td>List I</td><td> </td><td>List II</td></tr><tr><td>A.</td><td><br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/Object163-c80ea803-e0b0-43e2-bc9b-c29bc218e623.jpg\"/></td><td><math><mn>P</mn><mo>.</mo></math></td><td><math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math></td></tr><tr><td>B.</td><td><br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/Object166-0733a1bf-7553-43f9-963f-96537b46c8fe.jpg\"/></td><td><math><mn>Q</mn><mo>.</mo></math></td><td><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></td></tr><tr><td>C.</td><td><br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/Object169-27b114bd-253c-4cbf-9fd4-9f5bd29352dc.jpg\"/></td><td><math><mn>R</mn><mo>.</mo></math></td><td><math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math></td></tr><tr><td>D.</td><td><br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/Object172-848172d9-e718-4382-a378-05350dbfab2f.jpg\"/></td><td><math><mn>S</mn><mo>.</mo></math></td><td><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math></td></tr></tbody></table>",
